claim.claim-text:
- receiving (202), by a receiver-side device (140), at least one SNS message which may have been sent by at least one satellite (110) of the SNS (100) or may have been manipulated by an attacker;
- computing (204), by the receiver-side device (140), a hash for each received SNS message;
- receiving (207), by the receiver-side device (140), a validation filter distributed by an authentication server (160) for authenticating a set of SNS messages, wherein the validation filter comprises at least a probabilistic data structure, PDS;
- querying (208), by the receiver side-device (140), the validation filter using the hash computed for each received SNS message, comprising querying the PDS to verify if the respective hash could have been inserted into the PDS;
- treating (209), by the receiver-side device (140), any received SNS message, whose hash cannot be verified as being used in building the validation filter, as not authenticable by the validation filter; and
- treating (209), by the receiver-side device (140), any received SNS message, whose hash can be verified as being likely to have been used in building the validation filter, as authentic with a certain probability.

- a satellite receiver circuit (710) configured to receive at least one satellite-based navigation system, SNS, message;
- a communication interface (720) configured to receive at least a validation filter for a plurality of SNS messages; and
- a processing unit (730) configured to perform the method steps of the receiver-side device (140) according to any one of claims 1 to 13.

- each one of the plurality of reference receiver stations (130) is configured to perform the following steps;
- receive (201) a plurality of SNS messages sent by at least one satellite (110) of the SNS (100);
- compute (203) corresponding hashes for the received plurality of SNS messages; and
- transmit (205), to the authentication server (160), a plurality of message authentication bundles, each message authentication bundle comprising at least the hash computed for a respective SNS message;
